  "description": "A self-similar fractal fern generated by an iterated function system with 4 affine transformations, now hybridized with Voronoi displacement, an SDF vignette mask, and an audio-driven forest palette. Domain-warped FBM, chromatic aberration, mouse attraction, depth detail, and temporal feedback echo keep the foliage alive.",
